<title>USA: Heska IPO now has target price - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Heska IPO now has target price - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in Heska Corp was altered to a proposed target price, lead underwriter Credit Suisse First Boston said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The proposed target price of $10 per share is lower than the previous estimated range of $14 to $16. The offering maintained its proposed number of shares at 5.35 million shares and symbol as &quot;HSKA&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Heska Corp, which manufactures animal health products, is expected to trade on Friday.</p>
